Data and services:
  - Literature is retrieved at run time from PubMed (NCBI E-utilities) and
    Europe PMC; ontology terms from the EBI Ontology Lookup Service. Their
    terms of use apply to retrieved content. Retrieved text is not stored in
    or distributed with this repository.
  - bmira/fixtures/lactate_cd8.json contains INVENTED papers for software
    testing only. They are not real literature and must not be cited.
